      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="tilerReloadLayout">
       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="tilerReloadStatusLabel">
         <property name="text">
          <string>No pending tiler reload in this dialog.</string>
         </property>
         <property name="wordWrap">
          <bool>true</bool>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QPushButton" name="tilerReloadButton">
         <property name="text">
          <string>Reload Tiler</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="tilerReloadDescription">
         <property name="text">
            <string>Gap settings are saved to kwinrc. Session restart is the guaranteed pickup mechanism for gaps and startup settings. Saving gaps marks a reload as required; startup settings require a session restart; unconsumed settings have no running effect. Reload sends one typed KWin reconfigure request; the send is unconfirmed and never claims the running tiler applied the settings. This never changes shortcuts.</string>
         </property>
         <property name="wordWrap">
          <bool>true</bool>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
